# Replay parsing (completed only)

- Watch `%LOCALAPPDATA%\FortniteGame\Saved\Demos`. Open/copy with `FileShare.ReadWrite`; never exclusive-lock Fortnite’s writer.
- Detect completion by **file size stability**, then one header inspect. If `IsLive`, do not parse.
- Never parse in-progress/live replays. Do not clear `IsLive`, do not rewrite Demos, do not apply live PKCS7 workarounds.
- Parse with `FortniteReplayReader` `ParseMode.Minimal` (not `EventsOnly` — no player list).
- Worker + hard timeout; hangs are failures (`unsupported` / `failed`), not infinite waits.
- Humans: `IsBot` is not true, and `PlayerId` / `EpicId` present. POST **ids only**.

```csharp
// ❌ BAD
reader.ReadReplay(stream, ParseMode.EventsOnly);

// ✅ GOOD
reader.ReadReplay(stream, ParseMode.Minimal);
```
